robot-subtask-seg

This project is an independent reproduction of the public robot-video subtask
segmentation workflow described by Macrodata Labs.

Design references:
- Macrodata Labs, "Segmenting Robot Video into Actionable Subtasks"
- macrodata-labs/refiner, Apache License 2.0

Some prompt wording and contact-sheet implementation choices are adapted from
the public Refiner subtask annotation module. Refiner itself is licensed under
Apache-2.0.

